: "分次素理想"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "上文已见，我们对<MATH_0001>及相应的<SPACE_0001><MATH_0002>所作的构造给出了层（sheaf），分别取值于<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）及<SPACE_0002><MATH_0004>-模（modules）。因此，我们得到一个态射（morphism），见概形（Schemes）一章的引理<REF_0001>。该态射（morphism）限制到<MATH_0005>后来自典范（canonical）环同态（ring map）<MATH_0006>。映射（maps）<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>都是<MATH_0009>-代数（algebra）映射（maps），见引理<REF_0002>。因此，若齐次素理想（homogeneous prime）<MATH_0010>与<MATH_0011>-分次素理想（graded prime）<MATH_0012>和（通常的）素理想（prime）<MATH_0013>相对应，则三者的逆（inverse）像（image）在<MATH_0014>中相同。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:701de306323a42a67a77dc4d97bacdb1ef58b1460ea5348157444ccd9f4540d0", "unit_id": "tag:01ME:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "指先前构造所得的层。", "source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "指前一构造所得的层所取值的代数。", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "指后一构造所得的层所取值的模。", "source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"context": "指由所引概形引理得到的态射。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "指所引用的 Stacks Project 章节名。", "source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "指上一句所得并在本句作限制的态射。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "修饰产生该限制的环同态。", "source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"context": "指产生该限制的典范环同态。", "source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"context": "统称随后列出的两个映射。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "指两个映射保持的代数结构。", "source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "用于表明所列两个映射均为代数映射。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "指对应关系中的齐次素理想。", "source_term": "homogeneous prime", "target_term": "齐次素理想"}, {"context": "指带有原文所示分次的素理想。", "source_term": "graded prime", "target_term": "分次素理想"}, {"context": "指原文以括号注明的通常意义下的素理想。", "source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"context": "与后面的像合成术语逆像。", "source_term": "inv